$Av = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\ 4 & 8 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} (1)(5) + (2)(3) \\ (4)(5) + (8)(3) \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 5 + 6 \\ 20 + 24 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 11 \\ 44 \end{pmatrix}$

The result is a vector. So, we don't need to add units.
